OL,3,GNEWSATrio deny murder of teenage girl
OL,4,Ain row over boy
OL,5,
OL,6,FA teenage girl was stabbed to death by
OL,7,Fanother girl in a row over a boy with
OL,8,Fwhom they had both been in a
OL,9,Frelationship, a court has heard.
OL,11,FChloe Watson Dransfield, 16, was found
OL,12,Fwith stab wounds to her neck and back
OL,13,Fon Kennerleigh Avenue in Austhorpe,
OL,14,FLeeds, on the morning of Saturday 28
OL,15,FMarch and died in hospital a short time
OL,16,Flater.
OL,18,FKayla Smith, 18, Archie Rycroft, 20,
OL,19,Fand Blake Dowling, 18, from Leeds, have
OL,20,Fall denied her murder, a trial at Leeds
OL,21,FCrown Court was told.
OL,23,APub: 11-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,390,380,200,160,0,100
